WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:10.270
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:28.120
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:37.800
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.490
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.430
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:53.420
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:59.120
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:04.790
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.430
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:14.270
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.240
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.310
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:29.050
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:33.780
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:40.290
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.390
That girl...

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:32.710
Episode 13
INITIATION RITE

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:38.510
Isn't she?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:43.550
I'll learn it all!

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.690
The magic of the Druids,
the wise men of the oak!

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:49.600
Their poems, their songs!
I'll memorize everything!

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:55.170
Boy, that's a good one!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:58.610
Celtic magic takes decades to master!

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:01.010
Especially for a loser like you!

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:09.780
Honami Takase Ambler...

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.530
Good morning! Good morning!

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:25.830
Good morning, everyone.
Good morning! Good morning!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.320
Good morning, everyone.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.170
Tomorrow's the Magi Night.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.390
Let's do our best!

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:38.750
...like that, you know?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:39.640
Seriously?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.760
What are you waiting for? Begin!

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:02.100
Y-You go.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.430
You do it!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.530
Fine, then I'll start.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.970
Come forth, Forneus!
The marquis who rules 29 legions!

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:23.890
Bayu!

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:24.720
Tejas!

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:39.270
She wins.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.460
That's enough.

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.470
Adelicia!

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.120
You can tell she's a descendant of Solomon.

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.990
The next head of the Mathers family!

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:01.960
The daughter of Oswald Lenn Mathers,

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.590
the one they call the second coming of Solomon?

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:08.290
You won't pass the Magi Night
tomorrow doing stuff like that.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:17.680
Since there are no angels in the
layers above the fifth heaven,

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:20.080
you utilize the spell from Thursday.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:27.020
To construct the temple, you summon Caphriel,
Cassiel, Machatori, and Seraquiel.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.320
Excellent answer.

00:05:29.920 --> 00:05:33.520
Everything I say is just
what I learned from Father.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:46.470
Good bye! See you!

00:05:46.470 --> 00:05:48.100
Good bye!
Good bye! See you!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.580
The lessons they teach here at
the academy are so tedious.

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:13.390
The girl I see night after night in the library.

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:18.330
I'm surprised to see someone so busy
with her studies reading ghost stories.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:22.110
Your specialty is Celtic magic, isn't it?

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:25.310
The magic of the Druids,
the wise men of the oak,

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.470
who existed in ancient Europe.

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:31.220
It involved a huge amount of songs and
lore passed down by oral tradition alone.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:33.390
A sorcery no longer practiced.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.020
Didn't you overdo things?

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.920
You'd beaten those boys, hadn't you?

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:41.550
Oh, you mean in summoning class.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.730
It's good medicine for goof-offs like them.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.740
Is that how Solomon does things?

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:54.870
Perhaps you might say it's how I do things.

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:59.540
Sorry to disturb you. If you'll excuse me.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:35.310
The Magi Night is tonight.

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:37.990
Only those who pass this rite...

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:41.480
...will be recognized as
official freshmen at this academy.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:45.120
In short, a test that's a gamble on your survival.

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:16.050
So, in the end, it's a test of courage.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:20.090
The initiation test will be
conducted in groups of two.

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:23.720
Unless both can last the night, both will fail.

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:27.690
It doesn't matter to me who I'm partnered with.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.740
I'll just do what I have to.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:38.110
Honami Takase Ambler.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.350
Honami, you lucky stiff!

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.980
She's a shoo-in now.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.590
I can't believe they'd use an old
school building as a haunted house.

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:34.770
They're using spell wave contamination...

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:38.030
...to recreate the school's ghost
stories for the initiation test.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:39.200
Really?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.770
Look, let's me just say this up front-

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:44.840
Oh, sorry!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.140
If you want to pass this test, don't leave my side!

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:53.120
If you can just watch and not run away,
we'll have no complaints!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.190
Have you seen my head?

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:14.100
A headless ghost.

00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:19.350
The executed nobleman who wanders the
school night after night, looking for his head.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.180
I've heard this story a lot.

00:10:21.980 --> 00:10:24.470
Have you seen my head?

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:27.350
We don't know where your head is!

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:28.610
You don't?

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:29.480
No.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.460
Then give me your head!

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.030
Forneus!

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:53.910
Forneus!

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:23.370
Forneus!

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:39.520
Why are you intentionally breaking
the spell wave contamination?

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.430
We just have to last one
night for the test, don't we?

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.360
That goes without saying.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:49.840
To prove my superiority.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:55.680
I'm going to smash the core of the school's
ghost stories instead of waiting till morning.

00:11:56.180 --> 00:12:00.080
So, that's how you do things, huh?

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:04.050
Yes. I control my opponents.

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:05.350
Control?

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:08.450
Yes. Control them completely.

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:13.480
I'm waiting here till morning.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:25.330
Is that how Celtic mages do things?

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.970
It's how I do them.

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:30.780
I see. Do as you like, then.

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:45.350
Forneus!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.470
This is the core of the spell wave contamination.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:16.760
They've combined moon runes symbolizing
death with runes that symbolize the dead...

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:19.690
...to create a temporary
oversupply of spell power.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.320
If I break this, the spell wave
contamination will end.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:26.220
Now, let them see my power!

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.970
Forneus, destroy this gravestone!

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:45.680
Forneus!

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.900
W-What's going on?!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:20.820
They're all dead?

00:14:21.890 --> 00:14:25.420
It wasn't me! It couldn't have been!

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:28.330
Oh, no!

00:14:28.330 --> 00:14:30.160
The spell wave contamination is expanding!

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:42.440
Icchan...

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:48.980
I can't fail here. For Icchan's sake...

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.010
I can't fail here!

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:57.650
It wasn't me... It wasn't me...

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:00.450
I have to run.

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:05.360
Yes, I have to run...

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.600
I have to run...

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:21.650
I'm not running!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:22.710
Who's there?

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:25.410
No matter what, I'm not running!

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:26.720
Who are you?

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:30.450
I've decided I'm going to be the
best mage there ever was!

00:15:31.290 --> 00:15:32.160
Honami?

00:15:38.730 --> 00:15:39.560
Honami...

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.810
This isn't a dream, is it?

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:00.080
You didn't completely destroy the
core of the spell wave contamination.

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:04.750
Only the moon runes were destroyed,
which amplified the runes of the dead.

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:07.920
It's all right. They aren't dead yet.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:11.220
How... can you tell?

00:16:12.430 --> 00:16:16.600
I can tell because I've seen
worse things than this.

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:31.010
Icchan?

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:35.690
Over here! Catch me if you can!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:42.560
Don't...

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.890
DON'T!!!

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:47.490
Worse than this?

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.600
But if we don't stop this soon, they really will die.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:54.230
But, how?

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.500
We can do it if you help me, Addie.

00:16:56.710 --> 00:17:00.610
A-Addie?! Don't just make up nicknames for me!

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:02.100
Well, can you or can't you?

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:04.120
W-What's with that attitude?!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.090
I'm the next heir to the head of Goetia!

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:09.190
Well, it seems you're back to your normal self.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.660
W-What should we do?

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:16.900
I want to spread some spell power.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.390
You want to make the spell
wave contamination worse?!

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:20.570
That doesn't matter.

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.640
Just spread a large amount of it now!

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.300
Without the intensity of your magic,
it won't mean anything, Addie.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:34.680
A-All right, I won't hold back.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:36.910
Whatever happens next is your responsibility.

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:37.780
Gotcha!

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:50.860
I command you in the name of
the great and supreme one!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:56.070
Power which controls all directions and
the seven heavens, gather here unto me!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.330
Now what do we do, Honami?

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.270
Hail!

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:05.200
Forest! Forest! Forest!

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:14.280
Forest! Forest! Forest!

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:18.860
You?!
Trees! Leaves! Bough! Trunks!

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.560
Trees! Leaves! Bough! Trunks!

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:23.860
Harken to my voice,
all green children of the land!

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:25.190
That magic!

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:28.430
Celtic magic is attuned to the natural world.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:33.470
A special characteristic of it is that the user
draws spell power by appealing to the world.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:35.370
A descendant of the holy tree!

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:42.050
By the light of the moon and the
cone of power, I implore you!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:46.920
By the mistletoe which dwells in neither heaven
nor earth, strike the death to the southwest!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:16.920
After that, just two years after entering school,

00:19:16.920 --> 00:19:19.450
Honami finally compiled an
enormous amount of field work...

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:22.820
...to make the nearly extinct
art of Celtic magic her own.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:29.730
Thank you for bringing me this album.

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:32.460
Well, it was delivered to us by mistake.

00:19:32.670 --> 00:19:35.130
You all look like you've been
having a fun little chat.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:36.530
Honami!

00:19:37.540 --> 00:19:41.910
You're so late, I came to get you, but
it looks like I'm just interrupting things.

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:44.740
Oh! No. It's nothing like that at all.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:46.450
I don't mind.

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:49.710
But don't think I'll let you pass
on today's magic lesson.

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.610
Um, no! I'll come back right away! See you!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:54.010
I should be going, too.

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:56.750
S-See you later, Adelicia!

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:58.180
Excuse me.

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.820
You still have that picture?

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:10.630
Meeting you was the worst.

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:12.440
For both of us.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:15.200
Most of all, for your arrogance.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:19.650
Saying that you were going to be
the greatest mage there ever was,

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.050
to me of all people!

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.080
You heard that?

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:25.040
Of course I did.

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:27.050
I see.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.320
Honami, could I ask you one thing?

00:20:35.730 --> 00:20:37.630
The thing that made you want to be...

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.430
...the best mage there ever was...

00:20:43.940 --> 00:20:45.430
That's it, isn't it?

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:47.540
I'm not telling.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:54.540
Boss! Kuroha!

00:20:59.150 --> 00:21:02.120
So, Boss, Addie must have told
you all sorts of bad things.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:05.130
Like how I was considered a loser
when at school in England, right?

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:07.530
Um, no! Not at all...

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:10.560
People can surprise you with what they do.

00:21:10.560 --> 00:21:12.630
You should know that more than anyone.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:16.200
Maybe I should start giving you
a few more textbooks to study.

00:21:16.200 --> 00:21:19.070
Have mercy! I'm barely
keeping up as it is!

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:22.870
Still...

00:21:23.180 --> 00:21:26.580
Why were you so desperate to learn magic then?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.650
Um... Uh, well...

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.570
I'd like to know, too.

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.350
It was...

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:41.650
...for you, Icchan.

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:44.530
Oh, nevermind!

00:21:45.730 --> 00:21:47.320
See you at the office!

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.900
Honami, please tell us!

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:07.910
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:16.320
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:29.370
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:41.290
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:47.560
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.630 --> 00:22:52.060
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:56.340
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.340 --> 00:23:01.430
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:13.310
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.690 --> 00:23:17.360
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.360 --> 00:23:21.630
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.630 --> 00:23:24.690
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.030
Initiation [NYUUSHINGIREl]

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:28.570
Initiation [NYUUSHINGIREl]
What do they do for an initiation?

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:28.970
Initiation [NYUUSHINGIREl]
It basically works as a combination school
entrance exam and entrance ceremony.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:32.240
It basically works as a combination school
entrance exam and entrance ceremony.

00:23:32.240 --> 00:23:34.210
Wow, sounds tough! It's an exam, too?

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:36.810
Would you like to try the Goetia initiation, Itsuki?

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:37.280
Huh?!

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:38.610
All right, Prof. Miwa, give him the test.

00:23:38.610 --> 00:23:39.350
Next
Time
